{"uid":"8097c372024150e7","name":"test_a_partial_config_still_yields_a_bounded_sandbox","fullName":"tests.test_tool_sandbox_service#test_a_partial_config_still_yields_a_bounded_sandbox","historyId":"0cbaa44a82dffef4055de1beaac7b2cc","time":{"start":1789321152345,"stop":1789321152345,"duration":0},"description":"A config missing fields must degrade to defaults, not raise.\n\n    ``from_config`` read every ``tool_sandbox_*`` attribute directly, so any partially\n    populated config object was an ``AttributeError``. That stayed hidden while only the\n    standalone sandbox app called it; the moment the ``python_code`` node started resolving\n    through the same factory, a config carrying just the sandbox on/off flag took 27 worker\n    tests down with it.\n\n    The rule matches ``sandbox_from_optional_config(None)``: a caller that cannot supply\n    every field should still get a *bounded* sandbox rather than a crash.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>A config missing fields must degrade to defaults, not raise.</p>\n<pre><code>``from_config`` read every ``tool_sandbox_*`` attribute directly, so any partially\npopulated config object was an ``AttributeError``. That stayed hidden while only the\nstandalone sandbox app called it; the moment the ``python_code`` node started resolving\nthrough the same factory, a config carrying just the sandbox on/off flag took 27 worker\ntests down with it.\n\nThe rule matches ``sandbox_from_optional_config(None)``: a caller that cannot supply\nevery field should still get a *bounded* sandbox rather than a crash.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789321147976,"stop":1789321147976,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name"